---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Our privacy policy: cookieless analytics, no data resale, GDPR rights, and the sub-processors that operate this site.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Short version: we collect nothing that identifies you.</p>
    </section>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Data we collect</h2>
      <p>
        This website (vhsgreed.win) does not require accounts, does not set
        cookies, and does not ask for personal information. We operate no
        newsletter and no comment system.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, a cookieless analytics service that
        runs in the background and reports aggregate statistics: page views,
        referrers, device types, and approximate geographic region. It does
        not use cookies, does not profile visitors, and cannot be used to
        identify an individual. You can read Cloudflare's own description of
        the service for details.
      </p>
      <p>
        Even that is minimal by design: analytics answer "is anyone reading
        this?" not "who is reading this?"
      </p>

      <h2>Purchases</h2>
      <p>
        Payments are processed by Gumroad, which operates under its own
        privacy policy. We receive the delivery details you provide to
        Gumroad (such as an email address for download access) and nothing
        more. We do not store payment card data; we cannot see it.
      </p>

      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>
        If you email us, we keep the correspondence to answer it. We do not
        add you to any list.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served by Cloudflare (hosting, HTTPS, analytics). All
        other links (GitHub, Medium, Bluesky, Gumroad) are subject to their
        own policies.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Sub-processors:</strong> Cloudflare, Inc. (hosting, CDN,
        Web Analytics, DNS), Gumroad, Inc. (payments and download delivery),
        and the respective operators of GitHub, Medium, and Bluesky where
        you interact with those services. No data is sold or shared beyond
        what is required to operate this site and deliver purchases.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under applicable law (including GDPR) you can request what data we
        hold about you; in practice, for this site, the answer is: none.
        Contact <a href="mailto:lillerik.sund@gmail.com">lillerik.sund@gmail.com</a>
        for any privacy question.
      </p>
      <p class="muted"><small>Last updated: 2026-08-30.</small></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>